<title>FRANCE: No govt statement on Thomson-CSF bids.</title>
<headline>No govt statement on Thomson-CSF bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French government will not announce on Friday the names of candidates bidding in the privatisation of defence electronics firm Thomson-CSF, a finance ministry spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is traditional that the government never announces the filing of candidatures,&quot; the spokeswoman said, when asked whether there would be an official statement today.</p>
<p>Sale terms and conditions, published on March 12, set 1100 GMT on March 28 as the deadline for filing intentions to bid. Lagardere confirmed it is a candidate. Alcatel Alsthom officials were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
